nicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Movies", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use these nouns to talk about the people who make a movie.  The group of people who make a movie are called \u201cthe crew\u201d.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Film Crew/ Movie Makers</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">What the Person Does</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Writer\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Writes the screenplay\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Director\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Instructs the actors\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Cameraman\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Shoots the scene\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Actor\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Performs the character\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "The writer writes the screenplay. Alfred Hitchcock was a famous writer.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The director instructs the story. Steven Spielberg is a famous director.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The cameraman shoots the scene. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The actor performs the character. Tom Cruise is a popular actor.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "plot", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the story of a movie", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What is the plot of the movie?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le03ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "You can use these words to talk about movies.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "screenplay", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the script or the dialogue for a film", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: \"The Lord of the Rings\" has a good screenplay.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le03ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "photography", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the art of taking pictures with a camera", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Tom is very good at black and white photography.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le03ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "actor", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person (man or woman) who performs in films or on stage", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)",